OL,3,GNEWSAMan choked to death on croissant
OL,4,Aat his care home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA non-verbal man at "life-threatening
OL,7,Frisk" of choking died after a croissant
OL,8,Fgot lodged in his throat at a care
OL,9,Fhome, an inquest found.
OL,11,FPaul Spearing, 41, suffered a brain
OL,12,Finjury after being starved of oxygen by
OL,13,Fthe pastry at Essex Care Consortium in
OL,14,FBirch, near Colchester.
OL,16,FDespite frantic efforts to save him by
OL,17,Fmembers of staff, the "deeply loved"
OL,18,Fson died in hospital days later on 15
OL,19,FNovember 2023.
